  "_doc": "Layer 1 of collection: sports outlets. Each covers a whole country or league, so one feed yields many clubs. Derived from the 34 domains that produced the seed data - the top 23 accounted for 78% of all games. Layer 2 (per-club feeds) lives in teams.json, because small clubs are covered by nobody but themselves. A whole category was missing until the Nicosia draw exposed it: tournament ORGANISERS and ticket sellers publish the draw and tip-off times first, and no news outlet or club site is guaranteed to repeat them.",
